  "ruleText": "Mec 301.05 “Proof of successful completion of educational training or a formal educational program” means either a certificate of course completion, whether electronic or hard copy, including wallet cards or a course roster certified by the approved seminar provider for the course.\n\nSource. #10847, eff 7-1-15; ss by #13770, eff 12-10-23 (formerly Saf-Mec 301.26) (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Mec 300)",
